      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-282202",
      ":question/problem": "To test for brand preference, a marketing team surveyed $250$ customers, asking each to choose their favorite of five similar product designs. Among the first $120$ customers, $30$ chose the first design. Among the remaining $130$ customers, $p$ chose the first design. If more than $25%$ of all customers chose the first design, which of the following inequalities best describes the possible values of $p$?"
